      "value": "<p>A small dull ice moon with dark staining across the low ground, carrying a shallow brine layer that may or may not connect to anything. It has been surveyed from orbit four times and landed on once, briefly, in 2264. The 2306 programme has it scheduled for the year after next, as it has every year since 2308.</p>",
